1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Yang: Imagine starting your day with a sixty‑second check‑in
that actually makes you feel calmer and more focused.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Yang: We’re AstroAI — a practical tool and a thoughtful
companion that turns astrology into gentle, actionable
guidance you can use every day.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Cynthia: Most astrology apps push walls of text and vague
advice.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Cynthia: People don’t need more noise — they want something
personal, practical, and caring.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Yang: Our prototype delivers three core moments.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Yang: Daily Cosmic Insights with a tiny “Try today” step;
Compatibility with a score plus two strengths and two
watch‑outs; and a Natal Chart with a clean wheel and
plain‑English summary.

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Cynthia: We move from vague to specific.

8
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Cynthia: Old way — “You may have financial challenges.”
AstroAI way — “Based on Saturn’s transit, this is a poor
week for high‑risk investments. Try a 7‑day budget and
review recurring expenses.”

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Yang: We also go from passive to actionable. Our Event
Analysis turns signals into next steps.

10
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Yang: For an interview, we suggest communication tactics and
times of day you’re likely to be at your sharpest.

11
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Cynthia: And we’re deeply personal. Every suggestion is
synthesized from your unique natal chart and current
transits — not just a sun sign.

12
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Yang: Who loves this? Students who want quick clarity and
better sleep.

13
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Yang: Busy professionals who want timing tips and
compatibility snapshots; mindful explorers who want calming
rituals and deeper insight.

14
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Cynthia: Business model: start free, with Premium for deeper
compatibility, ASMR and guided meditations, and a lite AI
Astrologer. We’ll pilot expert sessions and curated
mental‑health content.

15
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Yang: Why us, why now? Our edge is a deterministic astrology
engine paired with an AI layer, wrapped in a practical,
caring user experience — supportive tone, clear limits, and
privacy by design.

16
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Cynthia: Today, the prototype works.

17
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Yang: Next — transits and notifications, the lite AI
Astrologer, then ASMR and mobile apps after the web launch.
We’re seeking mentors, pilot partners, and early users.
Thank you!
